<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107094" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκ-ρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flow out from under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὄρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>pass away gradually,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				203e
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέρχομαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GC</u>
				321b27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.4.42
			</span></i>; c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀμνήμονας ὑπεκρεῖ τὰ γιγνόμενα
					μετὰ τοῦ χρόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					46
				</span></i>
			; of a person, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκρῠεὶς τῆς σκηνῆς</span>
			<i>having slipped out of</i> the tent, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>waste away,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝόσῳ,</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπορρέω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.33.2
			</span></i>.</div>
